"`feedback <https://github.com/OCA/l10n-portugal/issues/new?body=module:%20l10n_pt_account_vat%0Aversion:%2020.0%0A%0A**Steps%20to%20reproduce**%0A-%20...%0A%0A**Current%20behavior**%0A%0A**Expected%20behavior**>`_.\n"
